    <h1 class="art-title">Why Inhalers Are the Gold-Standard Treatment for Bronchial Asthma</h1>
    <div class="art-meta">By <b>Dr. Jehangir Khan</b> · Consultant Pulmonologist, IRC Islamabad · 8 min read</div>
    <p class="art-lede">Most patients walk into the clinic hoping for a tablet instead of an inhaler. Here is the guideline-based reason inhaled therapy remains the cornerstone of asthma control — and where oral montelukast, oral steroids and herbal remedies genuinely fit in.</p>
